@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Check API health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Get demo products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Get a product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Unknown product returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999
Accept: application/json

### Get the root greeting
GET {{baseUrl}}/
